    "description": "Derived from 'gooper bed blowjob' (5 frames @10fps = 500ms). The shaft passes THROUGH the slime body, so the slime is a sleeve travelling along it, not a mouth on the tip: more shaft showing above the slime means the slime has slid down to the base = deep = 0. Proxy is that exposed area, negated. 6 cycles = 3000ms.",
